{"title":"Bandit","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 14 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-60.7px,-862.9px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/0/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/0/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/1/3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:768px\"><i style=\"left:33.0px;top:842.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-5.5px;top:867.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:76.5px;top:828.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:85.3px;top:841.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:22.3px;top:900.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:63.3px;top:880.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:103.8px;top:867.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:107.3px;top:874.5px\"></i></div><figcaption>Colossus Ruins</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Colossus%20Ruins\">Colossus Ruins</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 8 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"bandit\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">Cutthroat</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/a05493910fae18b77d43.svg\" alt=\"Bandit\"></div><h3>Bandit</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>14 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 14–14)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bandit</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>43</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>12.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>700</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.1 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>8 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}